  "notes": "QMReader: a Chinese-language RSS/newsletter/podcast reader. Warm off-white #f6f6f5 sidebar against white list and reader panes, separated by hairlines; almost no color except a small blue unread dot and red settings badge. Sources show single-letter monogram tiles instead of favicons. Unread items are bold with a blue dot, read items regular weight; the selected item gets a grey rounded fill. Reader has a 中文/原文 segmented toggle (translation vs original), a tan underline highlight on a key sentence, a '—— 完 ——' end ornament with estimated reading time, and a next-article card with a 'J' keyboard hint (j/k navigation). Live-only (not in capture): Aa opens a reading-settings popover (light/sepia 护眼/dark themes, font family, size, line height, column width); '…' opens a menu (copy, immersive reading, delete); the AI 对话 button opens a right-side AI chat panel with suggestion chips and model picker. 热门 tab reorders the list by popularity. The first-viewport image shows 40+ / 40 篇 counts while the full capture shows 134 / 134 篇 — state differed slightly between captures."
